## Attributes

```
export type LitSlotsAndCssAttributes = {
  /**
   * Heading above the projected content.
   *
   * @default 'Details'
   */
  heading?: string;
}
```

## Slots

- `default`: Default body content.
- `actions`: Action controls.

## CSS Custom Properties

- `--slot-panel-color`: Panel text color.

## CSS Parts

- `panel`: Outer panel.